[7:20p.m.] #IkoroduRoad #Oshodi #TrafficUpdate #Update 
Due to torrential rainfall in some parts of the Metropolis, motorists will encounter flash flood in some areas. 

Remember to drive carefully and reduce speeds as you approach water puddles.

Traffic is quite slow from Onipan all the way through Anthony to Odo-Iyalaro Bridge.

