[5:30p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate 

As work closes for the day, traffic out of V.I. is on the high side:

- Ozumba Mbadiwe is slow inward Bony Camp;
- Adeola Odeku is slow inward Ahmadu Bello intersection;
- Ahmadu Bello Way is slow inward Eko Hotel Roundabout;
- Akin Adesola is quite slow inwards Alfred Rewane and Falomo;
- Aboyade Cole is also slow.

You are rest assured that our Gallant Men are on hand to ensure you have a seamless drive and ride home. 

